+The banked joint chart and K=9 pin/lower-band certificates do not transfer by
+matching only `u_s` or the split-order set. Their chart hypotheses include the
+banked row's actual `M_2=77,V_3=8,V_2=8` data and the descended
+`(27,18;21;8;k=4)` row. S4 has the same `(u_s,v_s)=(3,8)` split-order window
+as S8, but it descends to `(27,18;6;1;k=19)`, so it is not the banked chart.
