+## Descent Map Used
+
+For a skeleton with top complementary multiplicity `u_s`, the unsplit
+descent data used in the charged `(99,66)` banked case are:
+
+```text
+n'   = u_s * (n/d_s)
+m'   = u_s * (m/d_s)
+M_2' = u_s * (M_2/d_s)
+V_2' = V_2
+K'   = gcd(n',m')
+k    = n' - M_2' - 2.
+```
+
+For the banked row S8 this gives
+
+```text
+(27,18; M_2'=21, V_2'=8; k=4), K'=9,
+```
+
+matching the charged K=9 case-A row. This lane uses the same map to type the
+other rows, but only promotes a death where the downstream chart was actually
+computed.
+
+The descended rows are:
+
+| id | `u_s` | descended unsplit row | status of available instrument |
+|---|---:|---|---|
+| S1 | 2 | `(18,12; M_2'=-4, V_2'=1; k=20)`, `K'=6`, `u'=5` | outside current K=7/8/9 k=4 pin certificate family; no joint split chart emitted |
+| S2 | 4 | `(36,24; M_2'=8, V_2'=1; k=26)`, `K'=12`, `u'=11` | large unsplit pin/order chart required; split chart unbuilt |
+| S3 | 4 | `(36,24; M_2'=8, V_2'=5; k=26)`, `K'=12`, `u'=7` | large unsplit pin/order chart required; split chart unbuilt |
+| S4 | 3 | `(27,18; M_2'=6, V_2'=1; k=19)`, `K'=9`, `u'=8` | K=9 but not the banked `V_2'=8,k=4` chart; split chart unbuilt |
+| S5 | 1 | `(9,6; M_2'=2, V_2'=1; k=5)`, `K'=3`, `u'=2` | order-basis systems emitted; open by timeout |
+| S6 | 1 | `(9,6; M_2'=5, V_2'=2; k=2)`, `K'=3`, `u'=1` | order-basis system emitted and killed |
+| S7 | 4 | `(36,24; M_2'=28, V_2'=8; k=6)`, `K'=12`, `u'=4` | large unsplit pin/order chart required; split chart unbuilt |
+| S8 | 3 | `(27,18; M_2'=21, V_2'=8; k=4)`, `K'=9`, `u'=1` | banked: all three configurations dead |
