+## Verdict
+
+The frozen Moh enumerator confirms the N1 premise: at `(n,m)=(99,66)`,
+Moh's printed conditions `(1)-(13)` admit exactly eight characteristic-data
+assignments. The banked row is the published/Moh-selected row
+
+```text
+M=(-66,77,97),  d=(99,33,11,1),  V_3=8, V_2=8,  u_s=3, v_s=8.
