+monomial-Jacobian order chart, implemented here by the corrected full
+order-basis emitter from `order_basis_full.py` and replayed through
+`box/lib/guided_gb.py`.
+
+S1, S2, S3, S4, and S7 are `u_s>=2` rows. A full skeleton death would require
+two disjoint duties:
